tyle=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">알선하고 청년층에게는 기업 안내를 통한 인식전환으로 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">청년층 인력수급 불균형을 해결해 취업률을 높이고자 </span></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">『</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">도내기업</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">청년층 만남의 장</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">』</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">을 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">아래와 같이 개최하오니 취업을 희망하는 청년층의 많은 참가 바랍니다</span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><br><strong>가</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>. </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>일 시</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 04. 30(</span><span style=\"COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">화</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #fa0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 14:00~17:00&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><br><strong>나</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>. </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><strong>장 소</strong> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">경상북도경제진흥원 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">층 강당</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">구미시 이계북로 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; F